  "notes": "{請求|せいきゅう}する is used as a する-verb meaning \"to claim\" or \"to request.\"\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {請求|せいきゅう}する (to claim, to demand, to bill)\n- {請求|せいきゅう}{書|しょ} (invoice, bill)\n- {請求|せいきゅう}{額|がく} (amount claimed, billed amount)\n- {損害|そんがい}{賠償|ばいしょう}{請求|せいきゅう} (claim for damages)\n- {保険|ほけん}{請求|せいきゅう} (insurance claim)\n- {過払|かば}い{金|きん}{請求|せいきゅう} (claim for overpayment refund)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {請求|せいきゅう}: claim, demand (formal, legal context)\n- {要求|ようきゅう}: demand, request (more forceful)\n- {要請|ようせい}: request (polite, official)",
